false_sentences.showed:
In ts and py:
- a 2xx gives ok true, status, headers and data, with no err;
- a readable 404 gives ok false, status, headers and data, with no err;
- an unreadable 200 gives ok false, status, headers and err (response_json_invalid);
- a fetch that fails gives only ok false and err.
Also seen: in py, a custom fetch that raises propagates out of direct().

